    "description": "Word Bubble is one of the World\u2019s most popular mobile word games. The aim of the game to find the correct word to improve you vocabulary. game is so addictive that you can not stop playing and help you have fun.\r\n\r\nWord Bubble is puzzle game best exercise to you brain and knowledge of words, In the game basically, words are split into syllables and players need to connect words back together by using bubbles.\r\n\r\nDownload word bubble and become a champion of vocabulary. Enjoy addictive word games! Game is free to download and free to update.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Superb graphics and well-designed interfaces.\r\n- Over 2000+ Levels to play word games free!\r\n- Play OFFLINE or ONLINE - anytime, anywhere.\r\n- Learn new words and train your brain to beat the game!\r\n- Gravity-based control.\r\n- Simply tap balls to connect words.\r\n- Collect bonus words! Earn rewards for finding extra words!\r\n- Useful clue that are available to help you when you are stuck.\r\n- Boost your vocabulary.\r\n\r\nDownload the best free word bubble pop game now!",
